            "value": "Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence handles rewrites and answers, but its small on-device model often misroutes voice commands and struggles to write scripts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 支持改写与问答，但其端侧小模型常会错误路由语音命令，且难以编写脚本。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 支援改寫與問答，但其小型裝置端模型常會錯誤路由語音指令，且難以撰寫腳本。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence prend en charge les réécritures et les réponses, mais son petit modèle sur l’appareil oriente souvent mal les commandes vocales et peine à écrire des scripts."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligenceはリライトや回答に対応していますが、その小規模なオンデバイスモデルは音声コマンドの振り分けを誤ることが多く、スクリプトの作成にも苦戦します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 可用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 可用。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence est disponible."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligenceは利用可能です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is unavailable right now. Configure another provider in Preferences → AI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 目前不可用。请在偏好设置 → AI 中配置其他提供方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 目前無法使用。請至「偏好設定」→「AI」設定其他提供者。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence est indisponible pour le moment. Configurez un autre fournisseur dans Préférences → IA."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligenceは現在利用できません。環境設定 → AI で別のプロバイダを設定してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence models are still downloading. Try again shortly, or configure another provider in Preferences → AI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 模型仍在下载。请稍后重试，或在偏好设置 → AI 中配置其他提供方。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 模型仍在下載。請稍後再試，或至「偏好設定」→「AI」設定其他提供者。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles Apple Intelligence sont en cours de téléchargement. Réessayez bientôt, ou configurez un autre fournisseur dans Préférences → IA."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligenceのモデルをまだダウンロード中です。しばらくして再試行するか、環境設定 → AI で別のプロバイダを設定してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence models are still preparing. Try again shortly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 模型仍在准备中。请稍后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence 模型仍在準備中。請稍後再試。"
